{"id":"433dd7d4f3bb14c3","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-public-coin-ip.md","title":"Public-Coin Simulation of IP","display":"thm-public-coin-ip — Public-Coin Simulation of IP","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-public-coin-ip","aliases":["28-thm-public-coin-ip","Private Coins Equal Public Coins for IP"],"display":"thm-public-coin-ip — Public-Coin Simulation of IP","depends_on":["[[28-df-ip]]","[[28-df-interactive-transcript]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 8.10; Theorem 8.12","source_printed_pages":"150–151","source_pdf_pages":"176–177","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-public-coin-ip"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-public-coin-ip</span><span>Private Coins Equal Public Coins for IP</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-public-coin-ip — Public-Coin Simulation of IP"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0b39f28135327595\" href=\"?note=0b39f28135327595\" title=\"28-df-ip\">28-df-ip</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3e270c20bc5033b3\" href=\"?note=3e270c20bc5033b3\" title=\"28-df-interactive-transcript\">28-df-interactive-transcript</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 8.10; Theorem 8.12"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"150–151"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"176–177"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{IP}\">\\(\\mathbf{IP}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0b39f28135327595\" href=\"?note=0b39f28135327595\" title=\"28-df-ip\">28-df-ip</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{IV}\">\\(\\mathsf{IV}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Strat}_b\">\\(\\mathsf{Strat}_b\\)</span> 与接受概率见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3e270c20bc5033b3\" href=\"?note=3e270c20bc5033b3\" title=\"28-df-interactive-transcript\">28-df-interactive-transcript</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>公开币验证者使用固定块长 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b(n)\">\\(b(n)\\)</span>，共 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k(n)\">\\(k(n)\\)</span> 块独立均匀币；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_{[u,v]}\">\\(r_{[u,v]}\\)</span> 为位区间。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{pub}\">\\(\\mathrm{pub}\\)</span> 标识下式定义的公开随机币交互证明语言类。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Public}(V)\\leftrightarrow V=(k,b,p,Q,D)\\in\\mathsf{IV}\\land p=kb\\land\\forall x\\ \\forall r\\in\\{0,1\\}^{p(|x|)}\\ \\forall j\\in[k(|x|)]\\ \\forall h\\in(\\{0,1\\}^{\\le b(|x|)})^{2j-1}\\ Q(x,r,h)=r_{[(j-1)b(|x|)+1,jb(|x|)]}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Public}(V)\\leftrightarrow V=(k,b,p,Q,D)\\in\\mathsf{IV}\\land p=kb\\land\\forall x\\ \\forall r\\in\\{0,1\\}^{p(|x|)}\\ \\forall j\\in[k(|x|)]\\ \\forall h\\in(\\{0,1\\}^{\\le b(|x|)})^{2j-1}\\ Q(x,r,h)=r_{[(j-1)b(|x|)+1,jb(|x|)]}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\mathbf{IP}_{\\mathrm{pub}}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*:\\exists V=(k,b,p,Q,D)\\in\\mathsf{IV}\\ \\exists P\\in\\mathsf{Strat}_b\\ [&amp;\\operatorname{Public}(V)\\land\\forall x\\in L\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{P,V}(x)\\ge2/3\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall x\\notin L\\ \\forall P^*\\in\\mathsf{Strat}_b\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{P^*,V}(x)\\le1/3]\\}.\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\\mathbf{IP}_{\\mathrm{pub}}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*:\\exists V=(k,b,p,Q,D)\\in\\mathsf{IV}\\ \\exists P\\in\\mathsf{Strat}_b\\ [&amp;\\operatorname{Public}(V)\\land\\forall x\\in L\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{P,V}(x)\\ge2/3\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall x\\notin L\\ \\forall P^*\\in\\mathsf{Strat}_b\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{P^*,V}(x)\\le1/3]\\}.\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{IP}=\\mathbf{IP}_{\\mathrm{pub}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{IP}=\\mathbf{IP}_{\\mathrm{pub}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>全部验证者随机位都在固定公开块中，最终判定无额外私有币。填充空首消息或空尾消息使本节点的消息顺序接口与书相容。Goldwasser–Sipser 变换给出多项式轮公开币模拟；本次核对 Theorem 8.12 陈述，未完整复核其模拟证明。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Definition 8.10; Theorem 8.12，印刷页 150–151；PDF 页 176–177。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>R6证据边界：Goldwasser–Sipser模拟证明尚未完整核验。本条可作为有明确来源限制的陈述记录，当前不作为已完成证明核验的依赖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-ip","status":"resolved","id":"0b39f28135327595","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ip]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-interactive-transcript","status":"resolved","id":"3e270c20bc5033b3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-interactive-transcript]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ip","status":"resolved","id":"0b39f28135327595","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{IP}$ 见 [[28-df-ip]]；$\\mathsf{IV}$、$\\mathsf{Strat}_b$ 与接受概率见 [[28-df-interactive-transcript]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-interactive-transcript","status":"resolved","id":"3e270c20bc5033b3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{IP}$ 见 [[28-df-ip]]；$\\mathsf{IV}$、$\\mathsf{Strat}_b$ 与接受概率见 [[28-df-interactive-transcript]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf{IP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{IV}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Strat}_b","display":false},{"tex":"b(n)","display":false},{"tex":"k(n)","display":false},{"tex":"r_{[u,v]}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{pub}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Public}(V)\\leftrightarrow V=(k,b,p,Q,D)\\in\\mathsf{IV}\\land p=kb\\land\\forall x\\ \\forall r\\in\\{0,1\\}^{p(|x|)}\\ \\forall j\\in[k(|x|)]\\ \\forall h\\in(\\{0,1\\}^{\\le b(|x|)})^{2j-1}\\ Q(x,r,h)=r_{[(j-1)b(|x|)+1,jb(|x|)]}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\\mathbf{IP}_{\\mathrm{pub}}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*:\\exists V=(k,b,p,Q,D)\\in\\mathsf{IV}\\ \\exists P\\in\\mathsf{Strat}_b\\ [&\\operatorname{Public}(V)\\land\\forall x\\in L\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{P,V}(x)\\ge2/3\\\\&\\land\\forall x\\notin L\\ \\forall P^*\\in\\mathsf{Strat}_b\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{P^*,V}(x)\\le1/3]\\}.\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf{IP}=\\mathbf{IP}_{\\mathrm{pub}}.","display":true}],"bytes":2316,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-135","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"协议刻画：[[28-thm-public-coin-ip]]、[[28-thm-ip-equals-pspace]]、[[28-thm-mip-equals-nexp]]。"}],"outgoing":["0b39f28135327595","3e270c20bc5033b3"]}